OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786544309
OL,3,CWheelchair user left 'humiliated'
OL,4,Cafter trip to Egypt
OL,6,FA woman in her late 60s who is a
OL,7,Fwheelchair user said her family's once-
OL,8,Fin-a-lifetime holiday to Egypt left
OL,9,Fher "humiliated" after parts of the
OL,10,Ftrip ended up being inaccessible.
OL,12,FThe plan was for Lynn Bryson, her
OL,13,Fhusband, daughter and son-in-law to
OL,14,Fspend two weeks in the country
OL,15,Fincluding a week-long cruise down the
OL,16,FNile.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786544309
OL,3,CWheelchair user left 'humiliated'
OL,4,Cafter trip to Egypt
OL,6,FBefore booking the trip, Lynn said the
OL,7,Ffirst thing she did was ask the travel
OL,8,Fcompany to confirm that it would be
OL,9,Faccessible for her as a wheelchair
OL,10,Fuser.
OL,12,FBut upon arrival, the family said this
OL,13,Fwasn't the case. Lynn said the vehicle
OL,14,Fsent to transport them didn't have
OL,15,Fsuitable assistance, while the shower
OL,16,Fin their hotel room had a step up to
OL,17,Fit.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786544309
OL,3,CWheelchair user left 'humiliated'
OL,4,Cafter trip to Egypt
OL,6,FThis meant Lynn couldn't wash
OL,7,Fproperly. Afterwards, when the family
OL,8,Fwent to board the cruise, the vessel
OL,9,Fdidn't have a suitable ramp so the 68-
OL,10,Fyear-old couldn't get on.
OL,12,FAs a result, she made the tough
OL,13,Fdecision to stay on land with her
OL,14,Fhusband.
OL,16,FShe said: "We couldn't go. And so I
OL,17,Fended up really upset, really
OL,18,Fdistressed. I still am upset thinking
OL,19,Fabout it.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786544309
OL,3,CWheelchair user left 'humiliated'
OL,4,Cafter trip to Egypt
OL,6,F"I had to leave my daughter and she
OL,7,Fdidn't want to go, so she was upset.
OL,8,FShe was worried about me and dad and
OL,9,Fleaving us behind. She was in tears.
OL,10,FIt was just horrible.
OL,12,F"She didn't want to go, and I go 'no,
OL,13,Fyou two have to go. It's not fair. You
OL,14,Fgo, we'll manage'.
OL,16,F"They were put up in another hotel by
OL,17,Fthe travel company, called Johnson
OL,18,FHolidays, but Lynn said the shower in
OL,19,Fthe room wasn't accessible yet again.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786544309
OL,3,CWheelchair user left 'humiliated'
OL,4,Cafter trip to Egypt
OL,6,FThis meant she had to use the sink to
OL,7,Fclean herself.
OL,9,FLynn's daughter Rebecca called the the
OL,10,Fwhole ordeal "very distressing".
OL,12,F"Nobody wants to see their parents
OL,13,Fupset and especially when my mum is in
OL,14,Fa wheelchair, my dad had just had a
OL,15,Fknee replacement, so he wasn't great
OL,16,Fon his feet yet either," she said.
OL,18,FIn emails seen by UTV, Johnson
OL,19,FHolidays said the initial hotel would
OL,20,Fbe "disabled-friendly" and would have
OL,21,F"wheelchair access".
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786544309
OL,3,CWheelchair user left 'humiliated'
OL,4,Cafter trip to Egypt
OL,6,FHowever, the company insisted Lynn did
OL,7,Fnot "explain the full extent of her
OL,8,Fmobility requirements".It also said
OL,9,Fthe walk-in shower was only requested
OL,10,Fand never guaranteed.
OL,12,FLee Saunders from Johnson Holidays
OL,13,Fsaid: "I believe the information which
OL,14,Fhas been provided was insufficient to
OL,15,Fus."
OL,17,FHe added: "I would personally
OL,18,Fapologize from myself and from the
OL,19,Fcompany's perspective as well because
OL,20,Fof the inconvenience that's been
OL,21,Fcaused to them.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786544309
OL,3,CWheelchair user left 'humiliated'
OL,4,Cafter trip to Egypt
OL,6,FThe company said it does not accept
OL,7,Fany liability. However, it did offer
OL,8,Fan initial refund of over #1,000.
OL,10,FAfter UTV contacted Johnson Holidays,
OL,11,Fthat amount increased to over #2,000;
OL,12,Fthe company said this is part of its
OL,13,Fongoing efforts to resolve the
OL,14,Fcomplaint amicably.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
