FL,414,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F413A1786544309
OL,3,CWheelchair user left 'humiliated'
OL,4,Cafter trip to Egypt
OL,6,FSaunders added: "And why are we
OL,7,Foffering such an amount? Because as a
OL,8,Fcompany, we have decided that okay,
OL,9,Flet's give it back and I'm one
OL,10,Fthousand percent sure that this guest
OL,11,Fwill come back to us again and book a
OL,12,Fholiday."
OL,14,FThe Bryson family said they are
OL,15,Fconsidering legal action against the
OL,16,Fcompany.
OL,18,FCatch up with the latest UTV Live on
OL,19,FITVX
